  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the climate vulnerability of poor people in Least Developed Countries by increasing resilience in sectors that are central to sustainable development and livelihoods, including: water; agriculture and food security; health; disaster risk management and prevention; infrastructure; and fragile ecosystems.</narrative>
